VALUES ('2025 Elite Officials Clinic', '2025-07-31'::date, NULL, '12:00:00', '14:30:00', 'important-date', 'Hough High School', 'Great Opportunity: Give Back, Earn Some $, and Wrestle!

We’re looking for 6–8 wrestlers to help with a Referee Training Session at Hough High School on Saturday, August 23rd at 12:00 PM.

Wrestlers will assist with live match scenarios to help train referees on positions, scoring, and situations.

🌎 Referees from across the country, including NCAA Division I officials
💰 NC United will sponsor each volunteer with a $50 payment
🤝 Give Back to the Sport
💪 Get Extra Mat Time', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL, 'https://w8v0puzioqkz0xzh.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/event-logos/1753965155983.png', NULL, 10, '2025-07-31T12:32:36+00:00'::timestamptz, NOW());

