VALUES ('Southeast Open', '2025-07-20'::date, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'college-open', 'Cregger Center, Roanoke College, Salem, VA', 'Description:
Established in 2008, the Southeast Open has become one of the premier season-opening college tournaments in the nation. This event features an elite field packed with NCAA Division I, II, and III programs and is known for launching successful college campaigns.

This tournament is designed for seasoned veterans and high-level prospects ready to compete at the next level. Only our most elite NC United athletes should consider entering.

Opportunities make champions—this is where they begin.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, '2025-07-20T18:33:43+00:00'::timestamptz, NOW());

